      "content": "the street musicians thing is a really interesting way to put it. it definitely captures that feeling of things being chaotic and almost... intentional.\n\nso if we're using that to help me understand my diet, how do these little musicians react to what i eat? like, if i have a really huge spike of sugar, do they go into a total frenzy or something? i'm trying to figure out if certain foods basically invite more of that \"sabotage\" to happen.",
